			"Message": "refactor(Maintain): Atomize Eliminate/Transform/Inline.rs into submodule files and fix Run/CLI/Cli imports\n\nExtract the three major sections of the monolithic Inline module (661 lines) into dedicated directory-based files, continuing the systematic atomization of the Maintain crate.\n\nNew files:\n- Source/Eliminate/Transform/Inline/Eliminator.rs (91 lines): Eliminator struct and EliminateBlock loop — VisitMut implementation for single-use binding elimination\n- Source/Eliminate/Transform/Inline/Substitutor.rs (145 lines): Substitutor visitor for replacing identifier references with initialiser expressions, including macro token-stream substitution and shadow-detection logic\n- Source/Eliminate/Transform/Inline/Tests.rs (303 lines): 20 unit tests covering simple inline, chain inline, binary precedence wrapping, question-mark propagation, macro substitution (json!, dev_log!), loop-body safety (#58), free-variable move-safety regression tests (#56), URL-parsing pattern, closure handling, and idempotency\n\nAlso fix Run/CLI/Cli.rs imports to use qualified paths (super::{Commands::Commands, OutputFormat::OutputFormat}) matching the directory-based module structure established in the previous atomization commit, replacing the old flat super::{Commands, OutputFormat} references.\n\nNo behavioral changes — purely structural refactoring for modularity.",
